  <trk>
    <name>Source trail from Komperdell to Fisser Joch</name>
    <desc>Beautiful hike with a continuous ascent (+450m) below Brunnen-, Sattel-, and Zwölferkopf. The paths are very well developed and even (whether it is necessary, I don&apos;t want to discuss 😉) accessible with a sturdy stroller.</desc>
